  "title": "Medplum Monthly Update - January 2026",
  "summary": "January was a packed month for Medplum. We shipped three patch releases (v5.0.11, v5.0.12, v5.0.13), published the 2026 Roadmap, and landed over 100 commits from 20+ contributors. The biggest themes this month were scheduling, the Provider app, and site reliability — all directly advancing our 2026 roadmap priorities.",
